UID:state-corp-washington-2025-04-15@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T122623Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Washington: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:No corporate income tax - Washington imposes the Business & Occ
 upation (B&O) tax\, a periodic gross-receipts excise tax. For businesses as
 signed an annual filing frequency\, the 2025 return is due April 15\, 2026\
 , though most businesses file monthly or quarterly instead of annually. | N
 o corporate income tax - Washington imposes the Business & Occupation (B&O)
  tax\, a periodic gross-receipts excise tax. For businesses assigned an ann
 ual filing frequency\, the 2025 return is due April 15\, 2026\, though most
  businesses file monthly or quarterly instead of annually. | Authority: Dir
 ect fetch of Washington's own tax agency site/publication this session | So
 urce: https://dor.wa.gov/file-pay-taxes/filing-frequencies-due-dates/annual
 -business-filers | This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not
  reflect a later-announced change\; confirm against the cited source before
  relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
